Package: YouAnalyser
Title: Provide Standardized Analytics Products for YouGov DACH
Version: 0.9.3
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "Emmanuel", "Guizar Rosales",
        email = "emmanuel.guizar@yougov.ch",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(Position = "Data & Analytics Innovation Scientist")
    )
Description: A collection of functions that serve as tools for
    YouGov DACH Analytics Partners. The package currently provides functions
    for data processing of labelled survey data, exploratory data analysis,
    Key Driver Analysis, Van Westendorp Price Sensitivity Meter analysis,
    and Segmentation (Cluster Analysis). Planned additions include
    Structural Equation Modeling, Implicit Association Tests, and MaxDiff.
